        421.65789794921875,
        106.53861999511719
      ],
      "text": "reatment of in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 16.799999237060547,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        118.42121887207031,
        130.37139892578125,
        135.2772216796875
      ],
      "text": "4.1\t C",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        130.5872039794922,
        122.42802429199219,
        235.6632537841797,
        134.2272186279297
      ],
      "text": "hapter objectives",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        142.97003173828125,
        513.4259643554688,
        156.321533203125
      ],
      "text": "This chapter focuses on first-line regimens and drugs for treatment of drug-susceptible",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        158.966552734375,
        453.9940185546875,
        172.31805419921875
      ],
      "text": "disease. The management of MDR-TB in children is addressed in Chapter 7.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        192.0330352783203,
        129.58740234375,
        208.8890380859375
      ],
      "text": "4.2\t P",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        129.8032989501953,
        196.0398406982422,
        337.831787109375,
        207.8390350341797
      ],
      "text": "rinciples of treatment in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        216.581787109375,
        513.42578125,
        229.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "The principles of treatment of TB in children are the same as for the treatment of TB in",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        232.57830810546875,
        354.8868713378906,
        245.9298095703125
      ],
      "text": "adults. The main objectives of anti-TB treatment are to:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        254.8857421875,
        230.1879119873047,
        268.35223388671875
      ],
      "text": "cure the patient of TB; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        274.35504150390625,
        356.26239013671875,
        287.821533203125
      ],
      "text": "prevent death from TB disease or its late effects; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        293.8243408203125,
        226.78390502929688,
        307.29083251953125
      ],
      "text": "prevent relapse of TB; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        313.29364013671875,
        431.8980407714844,
        326.7601318359375
      ],
      "text": "prevent the development and transmission of drug-resistant TB; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        332.7629089355469,
        296.6463928222656,
        346.2294006347656
      ],
      "text": "reduce transmission of TB to others; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        352.83221435546875,
        298.29083251953125,
        366.2987060546875
      ],
      "text": "achieve all this with minimal toxicity. -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        374.42919921875,
        384.7479248046875,
        387.8497009277344
      ],
      "text": "All children treated for TB should be registered with the NTP.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        409.8645324707031,
        130.37139892578125,
        426.72052001953125
      ],
      "text": "4.3\t R",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        130.5872039794922,
        413.8713073730469,
        261.4731750488281,
        425.6705322265625
      ],
      "text": "ecommended dosages",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        436.93731689453125,
        207.19239807128906,
        450.5648193359375
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 8 n",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        460.6918029785156,
        510.2044982910156,
        476.0257873535156
      ],
      "text": "The following dosages of anti-TB medicines should be used daily for the treat-",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        473.8918151855469,
        222.82933044433594,
        489.2257995605469
      ],
      "text": "ment of TB in children:",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        498.0918273925781,
        493.8144836425781,
        513.4258422851562
      ],
      "text": "isoniazid (H) \t 10 mg/kg (range 7–15 mg/kg); maximum dose 300 mg/day",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        522.2918701171875,
        499.93048095703125,
        537.6258544921875
      ],
      "text": "rifampicin (R)\t 15 mg/kg (range 10–20 mg/kg); maximum dose 600 mg/day",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        546.4918212890625,
        350.1544189453125,
        561.8258056640625
      ],
      "text": "pyrazinamide (Z)\t35 mg/kg (range 30–40 mg/kg)",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        570.69189453125,
        350.1544189453125,
        586.02587890625
      ],
      "text": "ethambutol (E)\t 20 mg/kg (range 15–25 mg/kg)",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        596.2133178710938,
        377.2218933105469,
        609.5648193359375
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, moderate quality of evidence)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        620.9498291015625,
        513.47412109375,
        634.3703002929688
      ],
      "text": "Rapid advice: treatment of tuberculosis in children. Source:   Geneva, World Health",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        634.8187866210938,
        321.4699401855469,
        648.1702880859375
      ],
      "text": "Organization, 2010 (WHO/HTM/TB/2010.13)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        656.8182983398438,
        513.370361328125,
        670.1697998046875
      ],
      "text": "Young age influences drug metabolism: a particular dose of a drug in mg/kg when given",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        672.8148193359375,
        513.3818969726562,
        686.1663208007812
      ],
      "text": "to a young child (under 5 years) may not reach the same level in the blood as when",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        688.8113403320312,
        513.4625244140625,
        702.162841796875
      ],
      "text": "given to an older child or adult. Higher mg/kg dosages are therefore required in young",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        704.8078002929688,
        513.46240234375,
        718.1593017578125
      ],
      "text": "children to achieve levels that are considered to produce effective bactericidal activity",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        720.7353515625,
        104.223388671875,
        734.1558227539062
      ],
      "text": "(1) .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        745.3108520507812,
        513.47412109375,
        758.662353515625
      ],
      "text": "Pharmacokinetic studies show that the revised dosages will result in higher blood levels",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        761.2383422851562,
        513.4279174804688,
        774.6588134765625
      ],
      "text": "(1-3) in young children, including those under 2 years of age  . Systematic review of the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        558.6439208984375,
        805.8439331054688,
        580.8839111328125,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "33",
